    "title": "On Convergence of Adam With Data Dependent Stepsize",
    "authors": "Alokendu Mazumder, Rishab Sabharwal, Bhartendu Kumar, Manan Tayal, Chirag Garg, Arnab Roy, Punit Rathore",
    "journal": "IEEE Transactions on Artificial Intelligence",
    "year": "2026",
    "published": "2026-01-22（收稿 2025-11-12，录用 2026-01-15，刊于 2026 年 9 月期）",
