    "title": "Unlearning or Not: A Strategic Data Forgetting Scheme for Federated Unlearning With Bounded Rationality",
    "authors": "Liang Xie, Yuntao Wang, Hengzhi Wang, Chunlin He, Huitong Jin, Laizhong Cui",
